{"id":"vb-cloze-01","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"这部纪录片播出后，观众的（ ）十分强烈，不少人致电询问拍摄地。","options":[{"label":"A","text":"反应"},{"label":"B","text":"反映"},{"label":"C","text":"批示"},{"label":"D","text":"注视"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"solved","group":"cloze","tags":["short","collocation"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
