{"id":"vb-cloze-04","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"依次填入横线处最恰当的词语是：他的讲演____，观众的情绪被____起来。","options":[{"label":"A","text":"引人入胜 调动"},{"label":"B","text":"打动人心 激发"},{"label":"C","text":"感人肺腑 唤起"},{"label":"D","text":"精彩绝伦 带动"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"failed","group":"cloze","tags":["multi_blank"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
