{"id":"vb-main-06","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"许多城市推广共享单车后，乱停乱放问题突出，影响交通秩序。因此必须加强共享单车的停放管理。这段文字的主旨是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"共享单车影响交通秩序"},{"label":"B","text":"必须加强共享单车的停放管理"},{"label":"C","text":"乱停乱放现象普遍存在"},{"label":"D","text":"城市应当限制共享单车数量"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"solved","group":"main_idea","tags":["short","cue-therefore"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-main-07","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"传统能源价格持续上涨，电网调峰压力增大。因此，发展分布式储能是缓解供电紧张的可行路径。这段文字的主旨是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"传统能源价格不断上涨"},{"label":"B","text":"发展分布式储能缓解供电紧张"},{"label":"C","text":"电网调峰源于结构缺陷"},{"label":"D","text":"供电紧张将拖累经济增速"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"solved","group":"main_idea","tags":["cue-therefore"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-main-08","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"网购确实便利了生活，然而退货难、质检弱、责任界定模糊等新问题也随之而来。这段文字意在强调？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"网购便利了生活"},{"label":"B","text":"网购带来新问题"},{"label":"C","text":"退货难是最大问题"},{"label":"D","text":"平台应明确责任"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"failed","group":"main_idea","tags":["turn","near-tie"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-main-09","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"古籍修复讲究'修旧如旧'，一位匠人处理一册虫蛀县志往往需要数月。年轻学徒从浆糊浓度练起，十年才能独立开页。而数字化扫描只能解决查阅便利，解决不了纸寿千年的问题。这段文字意在说明？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"古籍修复技艺需要长期传承积累"},{"label":"B","text":"数字化扫描毫无用处"},{"label":"C","text":"学徒培养周期过长应当缩短"},{"label":"D","text":"县志破损情况日益严重"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"failed","group":"main_idea","tags":["long","paraphrase"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-10","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"所有参评项目都通过了初审。部分项目组受邀展示了成果。根据这段文字，可以推出？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"所有参评项目都通过了初审"},{"label":"B","text":"通过初审的项目都受邀展示"},{"label":"C","text":"所有项目都受邀展示"},{"label":"D","text":"受邀展示的不是参评项目"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"solved","group":"inference","tags":["quant","literal"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-11","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"有些新员工参加了培训。李明是这批新员工中的一员。下列说法不正确的是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"有些新员工参加了培训"},{"label":"B","text":"李明可能参加了培训"},{"label":"C","text":"所有新员工都没有参加培训"},{"label":"D","text":"有的新员工参加了培训"}],"answer":"C","expected_status":"solved","group":"inference","tags":["quant","modal"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-12","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"这次会议不是没有成果。有些提案通过了审议。根据这段文字，下列说法不正确的是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"这次会议有成果"},{"label":"B","text":"有些提案通过了审议"},{"label":"C","text":"有的提案未被当场表决"},{"label":"D","text":"这次会议没有任何成果"}],"answer":"D","expected_status":"solved","group":"inference","tags":["double-negation"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-13","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"所有参赛队员都通过了体能测试。有些队员来自青训营。根据这段文字，下列说法不正确的是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"参赛队员都通过了体能测试"},{"label":"B","text":"所有队员都没有通过体能测试"},{"label":"C","text":"有些队员来自青训营"},{"label":"D","text":"来自青训营的队员都是参赛队员"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"solved","group":"inference","tags":["quant","negation"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-14","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"甲比乙高，乙比丙高。根据这段文字，下列说法正确的是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"甲比乙高"},{"label":"B","text":"乙比丙高"},{"label":"C","text":"丙最矮"},{"label":"D","text":"甲最矮"}],"answer":null,"expected_status":"undecidable","group":"inference","tags":["ambiguity"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-inf-15","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"如果气温超过40度，体育馆将延长开放。昨天体育馆延长了开放。根据这段文字，可以推出？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"昨天气温可能没超过40度"},{"label":"B","text":"昨天气温超过了40度"},{"label":"C","text":"体育馆明天不会开放"},{"label":"D","text":"延长开放与气温无关"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"failed","group":"inference","tags":["conditional","fallacy"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-arg-16","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"如果明天下雨，比赛就会改期。因此比赛改期了。以下哪项如果为真，最能削弱上述论证？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"明天下雨了"},{"label":"B","text":"比赛没有改期"},{"label":"C","text":"裁判临时有事"},{"label":"D","text":"到场的观众很多"}],"answer":"B","expected_status":"solved","group":"argument","tags":["negation","direct-rebuttal"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-arg-17","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"如果坚持锻炼就能更健康。老王希望通过冬天改善体质。因此老王更健康了。以下哪项如果为真，最能支持上述论证？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"锻炼需要场地保障"},{"label":"B","text":"医生认为规律作息更重要"},{"label":"C","text":"老王坚持锻炼了一个冬天"},{"label":"D","text":"老王去年体重增加"}],"answer":"C","expected_status":"solved","group":"argument","tags":["gap","conditional"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-arg-18","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"只有年满18岁才能报名马拉松。因此小明不能报名马拉松。上述论证基于以下哪项假设？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"小明没有年满18岁"},{"label":"B","text":"马拉松报名需要体检"},{"label":"C","text":"报名系统近期完成升级"},{"label":"D","text":"马拉松历史悠久"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"solved","group":"argument","tags":["assumption","only-if"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-arg-19","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"城市绿地不仅美化环境，还能缓解热岛效应、降低噪声、吸附扬尘。因此，有人主张在老城区尽可能多种树。以下哪项如果为真，最能削弱上述主张？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"种树需要长期维护成本"},{"label":"B","text":"树木能吸附扬尘"},{"label":"C","text":"绿地可降低噪声"},{"label":"D","text":"热岛效应危害健康"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"failed","group":"argument","tags":["claim","cost-benefit"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
{"id":"vb-arg-20","skill":"verbal_understanding","question_type":"single_choice","stem":"如果摄入咖啡因，就会延长浅睡时间。因此，受试者就会延长浅睡时间。以下哪项如果为真，最能支持上述论证？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"受试者摄入了咖啡因"},{"label":"B","text":"实验在双盲条件下进行"},{"label":"C","text":"浅睡时间用脑电波测量"},{"label":"D","text":"咖啡因代谢约需6小时"}],"answer":"A","expected_status":"solved","group":"argument","tags":["gap","consequent"],"source":"benchmark_verbal/dev"}
